60\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VJr0-inVnfEQ7kNvwEkqFNx&_nc_oc=AdqoB9OGrmZ5iR89r3wPnXLkk7YQJ42LicB-VEY1emboja7KmppvGhr9SHTOW_uQJdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Q6y3LGrhgBzlPKdAkBCJt30crkqcZqle3kLnTfSfjFQ&oe=69D64656"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-k9CqRSMNWAQ7kNvwGgQFPA&_nc_oc=AdrIKzHBYroIuu5Sc3LJnLMksgO5yYup9F56h9kybkXyEBJOoIwomcy5BwBjqdHprOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2vza1wxAXV2t0Uy_hqDsBpowIbyJpSczSZ4HDj8yJOjA&oe=69D6502D"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rTMr-qehpksQ7kNvwE11Ad5&_nc_oc=AdpxeORRRbzB_3RwJeZU_tM8NruoCRf7tWnmflQ7cjVCNjxJaXPYXi-ZI-fKXiyyF8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Z7XfSt9_usrCmJE6iLhW7ZeoPkh59Ag2WchjHxdIx6g&oe=69D6486D"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_c